Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.50,0:00:01.32,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,465)}H002  
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.50,0:00:01.32,TitleJa,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,575)}春、すべてがあたらしい
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.72,0:01:27.50,Header,,0,0,0,,H002  •  第2文型 [SVC]
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.72,0:00:04.71,English,,0,0,0,,The long winter ended.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.71,0:00:06.95,English,,0,0,0,,The snow melted.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.95,0:00:11.44,English,,0,0,0,,The fields and hills gradually recovered.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.88,0:00:15.27,English,,0,0,0,,The earth was awake.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.27,0:00:17.66,English,,0,0,0,,The air felt pleasant.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.66,0:00:21.24,English,,0,0,0,,Cherry trees were full of flowers.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.60,0:00:27.94,English,,0,0,0,,As I walked along the river, my heart became calm.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.66,0:00:33.82,English,,0,0,0,,My face grew gentle.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.82,0:00:36.52,English,,0,0,0,,The world itself seemed new.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:36.52,0:00:39.20,English,,0,0,0,,On the path I met a friend.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.68,0:00:46.74,English,,0,0,0,,She looked more mature than last year, yet her smile remained the same.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.74,0:00:49.85,English,,0,0,0,,Her eyes shone brightly.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.85,0:00:52.96,English,,0,0,0,,Her voice sounded warm.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:54.88,0:01:00.72,English,,0,0,0,,Children's voices reached me, and I felt full of pleasure and delight.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:00.72,0:01:04.62,English,,0,0,0,,A fresh hope arose in my heart.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:04.62,0:01:09.98,English,,0,0,0,,A small joy emerged in my chest.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:09.98,0:01:12.10,English,,0,0,0,,At night I remained awake.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:12.10,0:01:18.60,English,,0,0,0,,Everything was quietly but surely becoming new.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:21.32,0:01:24.48,English,,0,0,0,,The spring was young.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:24.48,0:01:27.30,English,,0,0,0,,The world seemed alive.
